{"script":"yd_015_05","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1e","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1e","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]你对黑森林的美食感兴趣吗？我们的宴会大师嘉莉缇制作过一道，当下黑森林最美味的特色菜……野蕈鸡茸汤。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]它是用被特殊的食用菌孢子寄生过的鸟类魔物熬制而成的浓汤，口感层次丰富，带有清爽的鲜美滋味。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]你问被蘑菇寄生过的肉还能吃吗？嗯……对外来者来说可能有点重口味。[r]但请放心，经过烹煮后，它们不仅无毒无害，还富含各类营养素。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]虽然这么说，我当时还想推荐嘉莉缇往汤汁里加入一些我特制的浓缩营养药水，可惜被她立刻否决了……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]如果你有兴趣，我非常推荐你尝一尝。[r]别担心，只要克服第一口的心理障碍就好。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"芭杜尔-熟识2"}